# Docker build-context excludes. The repo ROOT is the build context for BOTH the docker-windows clean-room
# mirror (cleanroom/docker-windows/Dockerfile.windows) and the tools/collab-cli/ci release harness. Without
# this, the root shipped ~105 MB of node_modules into the context (WIN measured 105 MB -> 3.5 MB with it).
#
# Do NOT exclude what the builds COPY: cleanroom/, tools/, experiments/, docs/, and the maintainer-staged
# .lv-feed / .lv-cli-feed offline LabVIEW feeds (the mirror COPYs those in; they are gitignored, not here).
**/node_modules
.git
out
coverage
reports
.vagrant
*.iso
*.vsix
